  "idea": "AppFlowy: the open-source Notion replacement that stays local",
  "text": "This privacy-first, completely free Notion alternative runs directly on your local machine. Creators and developers waste time waiting for cloud workspaces to load on spotty internet. Centralized notes apps expose sensitive strategies to external servers and fail during unexpected cloud outages. AppFlowy stores your entire knowledge base locally with markdown support, custom boards, and blazing-fast performance. You keep private notes completely secure and accessible anywhere.",
